        "created_at": "2013-01-12T08:03:42.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>When a villain card flips that doesn't count as a new card entering play, it is just changing what text is on that card.&nbsp; So Voss is always in play from the start of the game and will evaluate before forced deployment.</p>",
